{"id":"wb-6-876","name":"亚斯立堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"亚斯立堂","text":"亚斯立堂（英语：Asbury Church），现名北京基督教会崇文门堂，是位于北京市东城区建国门街道崇文门内后沟胡同丁2号的一所基督教堂，始建于1870年。是北京市目前最古老的一座基督教新教教堂，也是一所涉外的教堂，在国内外享有一定声誉。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%9A%E6%96%AF%E7%AB%8B%E5%A0%82","revisionId":95060517,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95060517","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2619e796f205abe7fb774b19.jpg","title":"Chongwenmen_Church.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chongwenmen_Church.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/Chongwenmen_Church.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Flsxx","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​北京崇文门堂。","width":320,"height":240}}